 "remarks": "Nestled in the charming town of Wilton, Hayworth Wilton offers a beautifully renovated two bedroom w/ second bedroom/den/office two bath townhouse style apartment home. Designed with modern living in mind, this home boasts spacious interiors that blend comfort and functionality. In-unit laundry, central air conditioning, off-street parking. Residents can unwind by the pool, stay active in the fully equipped fitness center, and enjoy the convenience of nearby parks, shopping, and dining. Combining serene surroundings with easy access to local amenities, Hayworth provides the perfect place to call home. Pets welcome. The nearby Metro North is less than a mile away and closely located to major highways. Minutes to shops, nightlife, and restaurants.",
